# The image build reads exactly two things out of this repo: the pre-built standalone payload under
# daemon/dist-standalone/ and entrypoint.sh. Everything else is context weight, so it is excluded here -
# a smaller context is a faster, more reproducible build (and never leaks a stray .env into a layer).
#
# Do NOT exclude daemon/dist-standalone: it IS the image.
.git
.github
.env
.env.*
**/node_modules
**/.turbo
**/dist
**/dist-bundle
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/tests
docs
*.md
